### Developer platform (P12). Admin parts need accessToken/storeId (a merchant session); developer API parts need an API key.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = PASTE_sfk_TOKEN
@itemId = PASTE_INVENTORY_ITEM_ID

### Merchant: create an API key (token shown ONCE; scopes can't exceed your own permissions)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Warehouse script", "scopes": ["read_orders", "read_inventory", "write_inventory"]}

### Merchant: keys (prefix only) and hourly usage of one key
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Developer API: orders changed since a time (sync feed; follow page.nextCursor)
GET {{base}}/api/2026-10/stores/{{storeId}}/orders?updatedAfter=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Developer API: inventory items changed since a time
GET {{base}}/api/2026-10/stores/{{storeId}}/inventory-items?updatedAfter=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Developer API: idempotent stock adjustment (repeat with the same key = applied once)
POST {{base}}/api/2026-10/stores/{{storeId}}/inventory-items/{{itemId}}/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: 5c1b3f62-0d0e-4b0a-9f4e-2b1d8c7a0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"delta": 10, "reason": "RECEIVED", "note": "warehouse delivery"}

### Developer API: the key's own webhook subscription (topic needs its read scope)
POST {{base}}/api/2026-10/stores/{{storeId}}/webhook-subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"url": "https://example.com/hooks", "topics": ["inventory_levels/update"]}

### OpenAPI document of the developer API (public)
GET {{base}}/developer/openapi

### Developer: register an OAuth app (client secret shown ONCE)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/apps
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "StockSync", "redirectUris": ["http://127.0.0.1:9095/oauth/callback"], "scopes": ["read_orders", "read_inventory", "write_inventory"]}

### Merchant: installed apps; uninstall = immediate revocation + subscriptions removed
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/app-installations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
